WEBVTT

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:03.207
but that is money and resources
that could be reallocated

00:12:03.231 --> 00:12:05.516
to mental health services,

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.484
to drug treatment programs, to education.

00:12:10.016 --> 00:12:13.592
And we're now wearing this shirt in courts

00:12:14.593 --> 00:12:15.997
all across the country.

00:12:16.347 --> 00:12:18.086
And people are wearing this shirt

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:22.323
because they want the immediacy
of protecting their people

00:12:22.347 --> 00:12:23.497
in the courtroom.

00:12:24.407 --> 00:12:25.952
But what we're telling them is,

00:12:25.976 --> 00:12:29.725
as practitioners,
they're building a new field,

00:12:29.749 --> 00:12:31.551
a new movement